its congruence-ideal denominator are supplied with compatible Katz normalization.
Hypothesis: The exact HT93/HT94/Hid06 theorem and integral comparison map must be obtained before
this contract is discharged. Those papers were not read, and no unspecified list of their hypotheses
is treated as a proved theorem.
Check: Consumed by L2s/clw-integrality (CLW's integrality of L_{π,K,ξ} through L^Hida) and requested
by HeegnerPointEulerSystems:HE.8b as 'Hida–Tilouine from proposed AC L0c'.
