Source: SU-2014, §6.3–6.4 (Thms 6.3.3, 6.3.10, 6.4.1), pp. 91–95.
API GU22Forms.space: V^q_{a,ord}(K′; Λ_2) and M^q_{a,ord}(K′; Λ_2) for q ∈ {0, 1} (cusp forms, all
forms).
API GU22Forms.qExp: The cusp q-expansion of a form in M^q=Hom_Λ(V^q,Λ), with injectivity on M^q by
