API GU22Forms.hecke: The Hecke operators T_v, Z_{ℓ,0}, Z^{(i)}_{ℓ,0} and u_t, commuting, with e the
ordinary projector.
API GU22Forms.specialize: Specialization at an arithmetic weight φ lands in classical holomorphic
ordinary forms of weight φ for sufficiently regular φ.
API GU22Forms.siegelOperator: The Siegel operator Φ to the boundary, fitting in the exact sequence
