Test gu22Forms_degree_one: For n = 1 the same construction for GU(1,1) gives ordinary p-adic
elliptic modular forms twisted by Hecke characters of K, with Hida's ordinary projector.
Test gu22Forms_qexp_injective: A form whose q-expansions vanish at every cusp x with x_p ∈ Q(ℤ_p) is
