H¹_Iw(ℤ[1/Σ_ρ̄], ρ̄^*(1))^η is free of rank one over Λ^η_𝔽, and H¹_Iw/Im(z_{Σ_ρ̄,1}(ρ̄)^η) and
H²_Iw(ℤ[1/Σ_ρ̄], ρ̄^*(1))^η are finite-dimensional (arXiv Thm 5.8 = published Thm 5.9); the η-part
of Kato's main conjecture for ρ̄ is the equality of their dimensions (arXiv Conj. 5.9 = published
5.10). (iii) For every x ∈ Spec(𝕋_{ρ̄,Σ})(O) ⊂ X(ρ̄): H¹_Iw(ℤ[1/Σ], ρ_x^*(1))^η is free of rank one
