or there is τ ∈ Gal(ℚ̄/ℚ(ζ_{p^∞})) with (ρ_x/(τ−1)ρ_x)[1/p] one-dimensional, then Char(H¹_Iw/Im z^η)
⊆ Char(H²_Iw^η) (arXiv Thm 5.10 = published Thm 5.11).
